0..111 Comment "/// `refinedPred` and `occupied` case on a lambda\'s binder whose type an enclosing case refined to a data type."
112..115 Comment "///"
116..237 Comment "/// Under the arm `Zero`, the binder\'s type `natOr(Zero)` is a call that returns `Nat`, so the case is a case over `Nat`."
238..327 Comment "/// Under the arm `ListL(a)`, the decoder\'s call returns a list type, and the same holds."
328..411 Comment "/// The kernel admits both declarations as the checker does, and both fixtures run."
412..415 Comment "///"
416..500 Comment "/// The checker unfolds the binder\'s type to the data type before it reads the case."
501..647 Comment "/// The kernel reads the decode of the returned call by its own evaluator, with every definition unfolding, before it reads the scrutinee\'s shape."
648..651 Comment "///"
652..668 Comment "/// - see: #2872"
669..715 Comment "/// - see: `../universe/decoded-descent.gandr`"
